.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local working notes, drafts, and host-specific deploy scripts
.dev/

# The one-shot v1 importer and its two follow-up repair commands. They were
# written for one operator's personal v1 servers, so they are dead weight in a
# public repo, but a local copy still has to be runnable. Restore one with
# `git show <commit>:<path> > <path>` and re-add its case to main.go's switch;
# these entries keep it from being committed back.
server/cmd/athena-server/migrate.go
server/cmd/athena-server/migrate_test.go
server/cmd/athena-server/migrate_assets_test.go
server/cmd/athena-server/repair_assets.go
server/cmd/athena-server/repair_assets_test.go
server/cmd/athena-server/repair_timestamps.go
server/cmd/athena-server/repair_timestamps_test.go
/MIGRATION.md
